      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_gym_denki_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "B858C1E597C45389",
      "text": "대박! 진짜!?\\n아~ 너무 좋아서 날아오를 것만 같아~!![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
